<title>USA: Minnesota HFA, won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Minnesota HFA, won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $4.650 million of Minnesota Housing Finance Agency, rental housing AMT bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.7952 percent.</p>
</text>
